==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Bergmite|29}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*'''Icicle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Snorunt|37}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
